  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e12-scene-07",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "下一步就是中国本土的原创节目  (Next Comes Original Chinese Programming)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After wrapping up successful negotiations overseas and visiting his old university campus, Chun Yuqiao attends a celebratory reception back home where his foreign partner assumes Xingtian will stick to licensing foreign television formats. Listen to Chun Yuqiao in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "今天的谈判算是彻底成功了，他们基本接受了我们所有的条件。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "所以我们的美国之行圆满了，辛苦了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我们俩就不要相互吹捧了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谢谢，明天可以带我去哥伦比亚大学吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你好，非常期待，干杯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "说实话，我擅长的不是版权引进。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我也不打算长期去拷贝国外的节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "星天的内容制作团队已经锻炼成熟。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "下一步我们要做的，就是中国本土的原创节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "希望作为最大的战略合作伙伴，能够帮我们把原创的节目打进西方主流市场。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "是的，原创开发没那么容易。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但我是中国的制作人，这些事就该我来做，不是吗？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "今天的谈判算是彻底成功了，他们基本接受了我们所有的条件。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Today's negotiations were a complete success; they accepted virtually all of our terms.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "所以我们的美国之行圆满了，辛苦了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That brings our overseas trip to a fulfilling close — thank you for all your hard work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我们俩就不要相互吹捧了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The two of us don't need to flatter each other.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谢谢，明天可以带我去哥伦比亚大学吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you — tomorrow could the driver take me to visit my old university?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你好，非常期待，干杯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello — we look forward to working together. Cheers.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "说实话，我擅长的不是版权引进。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'To be honest, format licensing is not what I specialize in.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我也不打算长期去拷贝国外的节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nor do I intend to spend the long term copying foreign television shows.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "星天的内容制作团队已经锻炼成熟。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingtian's content production team has now matured through real-world testing.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "下一步我们要做的，就是中国本土的原创节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our very next step is creating homegrown original Chinese programs.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "希望作为最大的战略合作伙伴，能够帮我们把原创的节目打进西方主流市场。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When that day comes, we hope our strategic partner will help bring our original shows into mainstream global markets.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "是的，原创开发没那么容易。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'True, developing original formats is never easy.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但我是中国的制作人，这些事就该我来做，不是吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet I am a Chinese television producer — shouldn't this work be done by me?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "今天的谈判算是彻底成功了，他们基本接受了我们所有的条件。",
      "gap": 0.5
