    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "希望作为最大的战略合作伙伴，能够帮我们把原创的节目打进西方主流市场。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "是的，原创开发没那么容易。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但我是中国的制作人，这些事就该我来做，不是吗？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Declaring proudly that developing original Chinese formats for the world is his responsibility as a Chinese producer, Chun Yuqiao is suddenly blindsided by news of a copyright lawsuit. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
